1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:06,258
In this demo, let’s say I want to experience Matthew chapter 9. I can read and interact with the Scripture at my own pace.

2
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:09,728
I can listen and follow along with the passage as it's narrated.

3
00:00:10,542 --> 00:00:19,656
Or I can watch as the Scripture unfolds as a slide show or a video on YouTube. Same Scripture. One experience. You choose how you receive it.

